  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>Раздел JJThunder to the Max: </strong></p>\n<p>Усиленная версия этого мода: содержит горы высотой до 2000 блоков.</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Версия мода:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jjthunder-to-the-max\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jjthunder-to-the-max</a></p>\n<p>Версия датапака:</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fjjthunder-to-the-max\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/jjthunder-to-the-max</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/509479/description_fc7c7fea-1c35-4464-a24e-5192f0665914.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Terrathunder v0.4.0 — полностью новая версия со множеством новых функций:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Крупные горы:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/529/2023-09-24_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"564\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/528/2023-09-24_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"564\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/535/2023-09-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Ровные равнины:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/534/2023-09-24_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"564\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/548/2023-09-26_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"564\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Глубокие океаны:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/542/2023-09-26_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"564\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/543/2023-09-26_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"564\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Широкие реки:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/551/2023-09-26_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"564\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/550/2023-09-26_14.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/531/2023-09-24_13.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Усиленные пещеры:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/546/2023-09-26_13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"564\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Красивые побережья:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/549/2023-09-26_14.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/544/2023-09-26_13.png\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Резкие плато:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/525/2023-09-24_12.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Подземные туннели</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/545/2023-09-26_13.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/541/2023-09-26_13.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/547/2023-09-26_14.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Плавные холмы:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/527/2023-09-24_12.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/526/2023-09-24_12.png\"></p>\n<p>.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/540/2023-09-26_13.png\">.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/530/2023-09-24_13.png\"></p>\n<p>.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/538/2023-09-25_22.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/734/539/2023-09-25_22.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Теперь доступно для версий 1.19.4 и 1.20.2 на Forge и Fabric!</strong></p>",
